pecial  thank you for being so open about your  journey and for fighting  so hard to make the world a better place  i couldn't agree more  thank you elliot for all you have done  and continue to do for the queer  community  oh hey there if you want more lgbtq news  and exclusive interviews click  subscribe or watch these videos
 

